<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">Roome</para>
  <para style="mt1">Roome</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesus Kiristoosa ayllene haware gidanasi xeygettida mishiracho qaala yootanaas kiitettida taape Phawulossape kiitettida kiita. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He mishshiracho qaala gishshi kase nabeta baggara geesha maxaafatan ufaysi immetides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mishshiracho qaalaykka ba naza gishshi izi asho baggara Dawite zereththafe gididayssa yootiza gishshikko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessaththoka nu Goda Yesusi kirstoosay ba Geeshatetha ayanan hayqope denddidaysi izi Xoossa na gididayssi gita wolqan qonccides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kirirstoosa sunththa gishshi ammanontta derey ammanana malane azazistana mala iza baggara nuni hawaratethas gathiza kiyateth ekkidos. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inteka Yesus Kirisitoosayta gidana mala xeygetidaytara deista. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossan dosetidaytanne geeshata gidanaas xeygetida Orome biittan diza intes wurisos nu Aawa Xoossafene nu Goda Yesus kirstoosape kiyatethine sarotethi intes gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Pawulosay Orome beyana lamotides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte ammanoy alame kumethan siyettida gishshine inte gishshi ta Godaa Xoossa, Yesus Kiristoosa baggara galatays. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta inte gishshi wuriso wode ay mala qopizakone Xoossa na mishshiracho sabakoni ta izas oothiza ta Xoossi taasi marika. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tani ta woosan wuriso wode intena qopoysa. Ha7i qasse wurisethan Xoossa shene gidiko ta inteko baana mala Xoossi taas oge doyana mala woossays. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Inte minnana mala maadiza ayana imotethi ta intes shakanassine intena ayfera beyanas laamotays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Heskka intenine tan issay issa amnanon ministanaskko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta ishato harason ammanontayta matan taas hanida mala inte matanika taas ooso ayfey beettana mala daro wode qopadisi shin haanno gakanaas ta digistada dizaysa inte erana mala koyays. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tamaridaytas gidin tamarontayskka, eratasine eeyatas wurisos ta bolla tamarssana accoy dees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Intes Oromen dizaysatasika ta mishshiracho qaala yootanas ta amotizay hessaskko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Aammanizayti wuri attana mala Xoossa woliqa gidida gishshi ta mishshiracho qaalan yeelattike; Hesika koyro ayhudatas kallidi hanko dere asaskko. <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Xilloy Xoossa ammanon deyees” geetetidi kase xaafetida mala Xoossa xiilloteth mishshiracho qaalan qonccina; He xiillotethay koyrope wurisetha gakanaas ammanon hanana.</para>
  <para style="s">Asa nayta iittateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tuma, ba iittatethaninne makali7an tucii oykizayta iittatetha bollan istta makall7atetha wuriso bolla Xoossa hanqoy sallope qoncana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Istti eranas bessizazi Xooss wursi isttas qoncisida gishshi Istti Xoossu eranaas qoncceko. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Alamey medhettosope haa simmini asa ayfen beetti erontta Xoossa hanotethi hesika izas diza medhina woliqayne Xoossatethay izi medhida medhetethan qonicen bettees. Hessa gishshi asay shiishana gaasoy deena. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Istti Xoossu erikoka iza, iza Xoossatetha mala bonchibeytenane galatibeyttena. Gido attin istta qofay mela go7ay baynidazi gididesine yuushi qopontta mala istta wozinay dhumides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Istti bena era gizayta gidikkoka eeyata gidida. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Medhina Xoossa boncho hayqqiza asanine kafotan, mehistanine biitta bolla goochettiza medhetethatan milatissidi laammida. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Xoossi istta ba garssan issay issara berkka ba asatethan tuna ootho oothana mala geeshshatethi bayndda laymmatethas aathi immides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Istti Xoossa tumateth wordon laammida; medhdhida Xoossa olla medhdhetethas goynnidanne isttas oothida. Medhdhida Xoossi izi medhdhinas galatettidayssa; amin77i. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa geedon Xoossi istta yelachiza amotethas aathi immides. Istti macasati benara zin7anas besontaytara zin7ana mala bena aathi immida. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessaththoka attuma asay bees bessiza macasatara zin7anaas bessishin addey addera zin7anaas amon xuugetidi macasatara zin7iza mala addery addera zin7idi pala miishshi oothida. Heytanti berka ba oothida iitta oothozas bessiza qixaate ba bolla ehida. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Qasseka istti ba qofara Xoossu eroy nuna maaddena gida gishshi istti oothanaas besonttayssa oothana mala Xoossi istta go7ontta qofas aathi immides. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Wuriso baggara makali7ane iittateth, yiiqene iitta oothon xalala kumida; qanatetethan, shemmipo wodhon, ooshshan, balethoninne genen kumidayta qasseka zigirizayta gidida. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Asa sunthu moorizayta, Xoossu ixxizayta, ase cayzata, otoronchatanne ceeqettizayta gidida, wuriso wode iitta oothanas oge koyzayta, bena yelidaytas azazetontayta, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yuushshi qopontayata, gida qaala zaari lallizayata, asas michchetontayta menxxe iittata. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessa oothizayti wurikka hayqqanaas besses giza Xoossa woga istti erishe heytantta bees ootho xalala gidontta hessathoka oothizaytakka minithetheetes.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossa pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi neno hara bolla piridizayso neni ta hanni geedon oothadisi gaada gaasoy neesi deena. Ne hara ura bolla piiridizayssan nerika nees kunane ekkaasa. Gaasoykka hara ura bolla ne piridizaysa neka zaarada iza oothiza gishaskko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hayta malata oothiza asata bolla Xoossa piriday liike gididayssa nu erossi <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hesa gishshi ne asa bolla piridashe he ne piiridizasa zaara oothizade gidiko ne Xoossa piiridafe kessa eka attana nees millatizee? <verse number="4" style="v"/>woykko Xoossa kiiyatethi nena marotethako kallithizaysa shaaka erontta dashe iza gita kiiyatethane iza danida7a duretetha ne liiqazii? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gido attin neni ne wozina mumetethanine marotethi koyontta ne wozina geedon tuma Xoossa piiriday qoniciza wode Xoossa hanqo gallasa ne daro hanqqo shiishshasa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossi isi isi uras iza ootho mala immana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lo7o ootho aggontta oothidi boncho sabane medhina dusi koyzaytas miidhina deyo immana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attin berika bena dosizaytasine tuma agagidi iitta kallizayta bolla piiridayne hanqoy gakana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Itita oothiza ay asa bolla koyro Ayhude asa bolla kaallid hanko hara dere asa bolla wayeyne metoy gakana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Gidikkoka lo7o oothizades oonasika Ayhuda asas gidin hankko dere asas sabay, sarotethinne bonchoy gidana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xoossi oonaka shaakk maaddena. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kase wogay eqontta wode nagara oothida asay wurikka wogay bayinida dhayana. Wogay eqi simmini nagara oothidayti wogan oyketidi piiridistana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aysi gikko Xoossa achan xiillo geetettizayti eqida wogaas azazetizaytape attin woga sisi siyzayta gidetena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wogay baynida dere asati wogay yootizaysa coo mela hanotethafe eridi oothishin isttas wogay baynida agikokka isttas medhetetha wogay diza gishshi istti ba oothanayssa ereetes. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Istta wozinay isttas marikatiza gishine istta qofay istta mootiza gishshi qasseka istta maaddiza gishshi wogay yootizay istta wozinan xaafetidayssa ereetes. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hesikka ta mishshiracho qaalan tamarssiza mala Xoossi asa wizinan qotetidayssa Kirisitoosa baggara piiridiza gallasan qoniccana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayudatane istta woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ne nena Ayhuda asi gikko wogan ammanetasane neesi Xoossara diza issipetethan ceeqetaasa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Woga kaalliza gishshi Xoossa shene erada kumethi gidizazi shaakka erida gidiko <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ne qoqista kallethizade dhuman dizaytas poo7o gididaysa ne amanetidade gidiko <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wogape ne demida eratethaninne tumatethan hankko eronitayta zorizade, guutha nayitta tamarisizade gidikko <verse number="21" style="v"/>Histiko neni harata tamariso agada ne hu7es aazas tamarikii? Ne hara ura kaysottopa ga sabakashe neesi kaysotazii? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ne hara asay laymatontta mala yootashe nees laymaytazii? Nees Eeqa ixxasashin Xoossa keeththa miisha bonqqazii? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Neesi wogan ceeqetasa shin woga ne baggara oothontta aggada Xoossa kawushizii? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hesikka “Inte geedon Xoossa sunthi hanko dere asa achan cayetesi” geetetti xaafetida mala hanides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ne woga naaga pollizade gidiko qaxaras goo7ay dees. Ne wogaa oothonttade gidiko qasse ne qaxaray coo melakko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qaxaretontta dishe wogaa gizaysa polliko qaxaretidadera gina qodetenee? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nees xaafeti wogayne qaxaray nees diikko diza woga ne nagonttade gidikko hanko qaxaretontta wogas azazetiday ne bolla piridana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Issade coo mela sunthas asa ayfen ta Ayhuda asi gidana gikko izi Ayhuda asi gidena. Tumape qaxeretethi coo karera asho ayfeni bettiza qaxxara gidena. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gidikkokka issi uray Ayuda asa gidanaas danda7izay izas gaatha baggara Ayude asa gidishinkko. Qaxarayka qaxara gidizay xaafetida wogaa xalala gidontta ayanan wozinape gidida qaxxara gidikokka hessa mala assi galata asape gidontta Xoossafe demmees.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Histinko Ayude asa gidethasi aaza go7ay dizee? Qaxaray ay go7izee? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Awaraka gidin go7ay daro. Harape koyro Xoossa qaalay hadara Ayudatasi immetides. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Isttafe issi issi uras ammanoy baynida aggiko Xoossa ammanotethi diigizee? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mulekka diggena! Asi wurikka woridancha “Neni ne qaalape denidayssan tumanicha; Piridanika xonizade gidaasa” hessaththo geeteti xaafettida mala Xoossi qasse tumanicha. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu makali7a oothoy Xoossa xiillotethi qonccen besiizayssa gidikko hisitini nu ay ganee? Coo asa woga mala palamistanas Xoossi ba hanqqo nu bolla ehizaysi nuusu bessena ganeyee? Hesaka ta giizay asatho qofankko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tumape hessaththo hanena. Hesatho haniza gidiko Xoossi alame bolla wostti piiridanidee? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta woridotethi Xoossa tumatethi qonccisizayssan iza bonicho gede gujiizassa gidikko hisitin ha7i gakanas wostti ta bolla nagarancha mala piiridetize?” giidi pallamistana assi daana danda7ees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gussi “Lo7oy yaana mala ane iitta oothosu” geetesi gidi issi issi asati nu bolla woresizayssa malakko. Hayta asata bolla gakkiza piiriday tumu piiridako.</para>
  <para style="s">Asi wuri nagaranchako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Histinni nu aazi ginoo? Nuni isttafe adhizonii? Mulekka adhoko. Ayhudata gidikkoka hanikko dere asa gidikokka wurikka nagarape garisa baggara diza gish ta wursikka kassistada isttas yootadis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Xiilloy oonikka deena issi uraykka deena. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yuushi qopiizadey bawa; Xoossu koyzay issadeyka bawa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wurikka balletidane issi bolla go7onttayta gidida. Loo7o oothizay oonikka bawa; issadeykka deena” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Istta duunay doya diza duufo mala istta duunay wuriso wode hasa7ees. Istta meterishay shoosha marzzera dees.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Istta duunan qanigethin cammo miish kumides.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Istta tooy suuthu gussanasi eesotees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Istta ogen dhayosoyne mulera dipp gi dhayoy dees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Istti Sarotetha oge eri eretena <verse number="18" style="v"/>Istta ayfesonni Xoossas baboy bawa” geeteti xaafettida malakko. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi duunay wurikka goridistana mala derey kumetha Xoossas mallithe immana mala wogay gizay wurikka wogape garsara dizaytas gididaysa nu eroosu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi wogay nagaray aazakone erisees attiin wogaa nagon oonikka iza achani xiillo geetistanas danida7ena.</para>
  <para style="s">Amanon bettiza xiilloteth.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse wogaa kasse nabeti izas marikatidaysi wogape karera gidida Xoossa xiilloteth qonicides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessi Xoossa xiillotethi Yesus Kirisitoosa amanon dummatethi bayndda bettiza xiillotethikko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gaasoykka asi wurikka nagara oothides. Xoossa bonichoykka asa naas paciides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asay Yesus Kirisitoosay, asa na gishshi oothida kiyatethafe denididayssan coo mela xiillides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iza suuthan gidida ammanon naagarape maristana yarsho histtid Xoossi Yesusa shishides. Izi hessa oothiday kassetidi polletida nagara qaxayonta danida7a adhida ba xiillotethi bessaanaskko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Izi hessa ha wodezan oothiday ba xiillotetha heskka ba baggara xiillo gidi Yesus Kirisitoosan ammanizade xiilisizaysa bessanaskko. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Histinni nuni izan ceeqettiza miishshi aazi dizee? aykko miishshankka ceeqetokko. Nu ceeqistana gaasoy aazee? woga naagiza gishshee? gidenna ammanonkko. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ay asikka ammanon attin woga naagon atonttaysa nu geeshshi yoottos. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Xoossi Ayhudata Xoossu xalalaa? Haniko dere asaskka Xoossu gidenee? Ee hanko dere asaskka izi Xoossa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Qaxaretidayssa ammanon qasse qaxaretonitaysakka he ammanonikka xiillisizayka izi isi Xoossa xalalakko. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Histin hessi hessa gidikko ammano geedon woga go7ay bayndazi oothinoo? Muleka hessaththo hanena. woga nu minthana attin.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Abiramey amanon xiillides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gish kasse nu Abiramey hayssafe ay go7a demide ginoo? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abiramey ba oothon xiilidako izi ceeqistanayssi deesiko shin; izi Xoossa siinithan ceeqetenas danida7ena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay “Abiramey Xoossu ammanidesine iza ammanoy izas xiillotethan qoodetides” gees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issi uray ootho oothiko izi ekiza miishay izas coo kiyatethi immetizayssa gidontta izades ootho waga gides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Gido attin ootho oothontta nagarancha ura xiillo kessiza Xoossan ammanizaades iza ammanoy izas xiillotethen taybetteyes. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Dawiteykka xiillotethi izas qoodettizay loo7o oothon gidontta asa gishshi hiziges, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Isttas istta bolla oothoy atto geetetidaytine istta nagaray maretidayt anijjetidayta. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iza nagara Goday muleka qoodontadey izi anijjtidade” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ha anijjozi qaxarretidaytas xalalayee? woykko qaxaretontaytasaraa? kase koyro nu Aawa Abirame ammanoy izas xiillotethan paydetides gidos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Histin wani izas hessaththo paydetide? Izi qaxaretidape guye? woykko qaxaristanape kassee? Izas xiillotethan paydetiday izi qaxaristanape sinithana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Izi kasse qaxaristanape kasse demmida xiillotethay qaxarisi malata gidida heskka xiillotethas matame ekides. Hessa gish qaxaretontta ammanizaytas xiillotethi paydistana mala wurisotasi izi Aawa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Izi qaxaretidaytaskka Aawa qaxaretidaytas xalala gidontta nu Aawa Abiramey kasse qaxaristanape sinithe izas diza ammano geedo kallizaytas wurisossa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammaniza asas immettida ufayss</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Izi alame latizade gidana mala Abirimeynne iza zereththati ufaysa qaala ekiday waga baggara gidontta ammanon gidida xiillotethankko. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Woga nagizayti lattizayta gidiko ammanos go7ay deenna; ufaysikka coo mela gidana shin. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wogay hanqqo kalethes. wogay baynidason wogappe adhethi deenna. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ufaysi ammanon yides. Hessikka iza ufaysay iza kiiyatethan gidanadanine Abirame zerethasi wurisosi ammanetizayssa gidana mala hanides. Hesikka wogan izayta gididaytas xalala gidontta ammanon Abirame nayta gididaytas wurisotaskko. Izikka nuus wurisoskka Aawako. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hesikka “Ta nena daro dere Aawa oothidis” geeteti xaafetida mala hanides. Izikka hayqidaytas deyo immizaden baynidayssa qasse diza mala oothizaden ammanida Xoossa sinithan izi nuusu Aawakko. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kasse izas “Ne zerethi hessaththo hanana” geetetida mala ayko ufaysikka baynida dishin Abiramey Xoossi hanana gidaysa ammanidi daro dere Aawa gidides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abiramesi yelettini xeetu layith gidi kichin Abiramey ba asatethay hayqetha mala gididaysanne sarasi yello wodey aadhi bidaysa erisheka ammanon lepibeyna. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gede gujjid ammanon minidi Xoossas boncho immides attin Xoossi gida qaala sidhibeyna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossi izas immida ufaysay polistanaysa kumetha wozinape ammanides. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi izasi xiillotethan qodetides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Izas xiillotethan paydetides” giza qaala xaafettiday izas xalala gidena. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Gido attin Xoossi nu xiillotetha iza baggara paydiza nu Goda Yesusa hayqope denithidaysan ammaniza nusarakko. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Izi nu nagara gishshi hayqanasi aadhi immetides. Izi nuna xiillota hisitina hayqope denidides.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sarotethine ufaysi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Histiko nuni xiillida gishshi nu Goda Yesus Kirisitoosa baggara nuusu Xoossara sarotethi dees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hayssa ha ammanozan miinid diza kiyatethan nuni geliday iza baggara gidida gishshi ufayssan Xoossa boncho gishetti ekizayta gidida gishshi nu ufa7etosu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hayssan xalala gidontta nuna gakiza waayenkka ufa7eetoos. Gaasoyka waayey danda7an gathizaysa nu erosu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Danida7ay paaccen minoteth immes; paaccen minoteth ufaysi immees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>He ufaysay nuna qasse nuna yellachena. Xoossi nuusu immida xiillo ayanan ba siqqo nu wozinan gusiida gishshi he ufayssay nuna yellan gathena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu daburanchata gidi dishin Xoossa wodey gakida mala Kirisitoosay nu nagara gishshi hayqides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xiillo asa gishshi hayqana asi bistanays daro metees. Loo7o asa gishshi hayqanas xalana asi oonee erizay bettana dandda7ees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attin nu buro nagaranicha gidi uttidishin Kiristoosay nu gishshi hayqides. Hesikka Xoossi nuna siqiza ba siiqo heysan besses. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuni iza suuthan geyidayta gidikko harappeka iza baggara Xoossa hanqqofe attana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu Xoossas morketa gidi dishe iza naaza hayqon izara giigidayta gidikko nu izara giigdappe guye iza shemppo baggara nuni keehi attana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa xalala gidenna; qassekka nuni ha7i izara giiga demmida nu Goda Yesusi kiristoosa baggara Xoossankka ufays oothos.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqoy Addame baggara, deyoy Kiristoosa baggara yides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi nagaray issade geedon duge ha alameza yida mala hayqoykka nagara geedon yides. Hayqoykka hessa baggara asa wurisoko yides. hessas gaasoy asi wurikka iza baggara nagara oothida gishshikko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wogay immettanape kase nagaray biitta bolla deesishin wogay baynddason nagaray nagara gidena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Addameppe ha simmin Muse wode gakkanaas diza woden Addame mala woga menththid nagara oothontayta bollaka hayqoy kawotides. Addamey buro yaana kiristoosas lemisokko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gidikokka iza kiyatetha immotay asa qoho mala gidena. Issadey mooridayssan daro asay hayqqikokka Xoossa kiyatethanine issi asi Yesusi kiristoosa kiyatethan yida immotay darotas keehi dari immetides. <verse number="16-17" style="v"/>Qasseka Xoossa immotay issade baggara yida nagarappe beettida ayife mala gidenna. Gaasoykka iza piriday issade nagara kaallid pirida ekki yides. Iza immotay qase daro qoho geedon xiilloteth ehides. Hayqoy hayssade baggara kawotidayssa gidikko daro tiripa gidida Xoossa kiyatethinne xiillotetha immota ekkidayti issade baggara hessika Yesusi kiristoosa baggara xoonidi deyon daana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hisitko issade qoho geedon piriday asa wuriso bolla gakkida mala hessathokka issade xiillotetha oothon asi wurisos deyo immiza xiillotethi beettides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Issadey azazetontta ixxida gishshi daro asay nagarancha gidida mala issade azazetethan qase daroti xiillana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wogay yiin mooroy darides. Gido attin nagaray daroyssafe bollara Xoossa kiyatethi keehi darides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hesska handay nagaray hayqo bolla kawotidayssa mala Yesus kiristoosa baggara qasse medhina deyoy bettana mala iza kiyatethan kawotanaskko.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Histin nu ay giinoo? Xoossa kiyatethi darana mala nagara gujji othinoo? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mulekka gidenna. Nuni nagaras hayqidosu. Histin hayssafe guye nu waani nagaran daanee? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuni Yesusi Kiristoosara issino gidana mala xamaqetidayti iza hayqon nu issife gidanas xamaqetidayssa hayssa inte ereketii? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Kiristoosay ba Aawa bonchon hayqoppe denddida mala nunikka hessaththo ooratha deyon daanas xinqqaten hayqqidi izara moogetidosd. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nuni hessa mala hayqon izara isife gidikko qasse denithanka izara isife gidosu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayssafe guye nu nagarasi aylle gidontta mala nagara asatethay kiichana mala kase nu ceea asatethay izara isife kaqetidayssa nu erosu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gaasoykka hayqida asi nagarape shemipidis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nuni Kiristoosara hayqidayti gidikko nu izara isife danaysa ammanosu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kiristoosay hayqope denidida gishshi nam7antho izi hayqonitaysanne iza bolla hayqossa wolqay bayndayssa nu erosu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Izi hayqida wode isito wursi nagara gishshi hayqides. Gida attin Xoossas paaxa dusu dees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessaththoka inte nagaras hayqidi Xoossas Yesus Kiristoosa baggara paxxa dizaysa erite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi iitta oothana koyza iitta asho qofa koydi hayqida inte asatetha bolla nagaray kawotana mala oothofite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte asatetha iitta ootho oothiza mishi oothi nagaras harisopite. Hessa mala oothanape hayqope gede deyon pinida asata mala intena Xoossa harisite. Inte asatetha xiillotetha miishsha mala Xoossas harisite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Inte Xoossa kiiyatetha garisan deista attiin woga garisan dontta gishshi intena nagaray haarena.</para>
  <para style="s">Xiillotetha oothanchata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Histin aazi oothinoo? wogaa garisan gidontta nuni Xoossa kiyatetha garisan diza gishshi nagara oothonoo? mule oothanaas bessena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte intena aylle mala shiishshiza wode inte azazetizades aylle gididayssa ereista. Hessaththoka gede hayqokko efiza nagaras woykko xiilotethako gathiza azazetethas inte aylle gididayssa ereketii? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Inte kasse nagaras ayllista gidikko intes imettida timiritezas inte wozanappe azazetida gishshi Xoossi galateto. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inte nagarape wozetidi xiillotethas aylle gididista. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hayssa ta asa qaalan intes qonccen yootizay inte Yeletethan daburanicha gidida gishshikko. Inte kase wode inte asatetha aylletethasine kassepe adhi iittana mala oothi immista shin ha7i qasse gede geeshatethako efiza xiillotethes aylle hisiti haarisite. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Inte kasse nagarasi aylletidi diza wode inte xiillotethafe mella atidista shin. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse inte yelatiza miishshatape he wode ay go7a demmidetii? Hessa he hanoza go7ay hayqoko. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse inte nagarape wozetidi Xoossa ayllista gididista. Hessikka Intena gede geeshatethako kallethes. wurisethaykka medhina deyoko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nagara waagay hayqokko. Xoossa immotay gidiko Goda Yesus Kiristoosa baggara medhiina deyoko.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ekone gelo leemuso.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato tani wogaa eriza asatas yootays. Wogaa shemipora paxxa diza asa xalala harizayssa inte ereketii? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Issi macashi azina geliko ba azinara wogan iza qachetizay azinay paxxa diza wode gakanaskko. Azinay hayqiko iza machcho gidiza wogape anjjistaysu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Gido attin azinay paxxa dishin iza hara azina gelliko laymatasusu geetistaysu. Azinay hayqiko qase hara ura iza gelliko kase azina wogape anjjistadus attin layma getetuku. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta ishato inteka Yesus Kiristoosa asho baggara wogas hayqidista. Inte hayqope denidida kiristoosa bagga gidin nuni Xoossas ayfe ayfanaskko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nagarancha medhetetha shenen nu diza wode hayqo ayfe nu ayfana mala wogay denththethida nagara amoy nu bolla oothides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha7i gidiko kasse nuna waaxi qachida hayqida gishshi wogape wozetidosu. Hesikka kase cega wogan xaafetidayssan gidontta dishe ooratha ayana ogen nuni oothanaskko.</para>
  <para style="s">Nagarara baxeteth.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Histin nu ay ginoo? Be hu7es wogay naragaa? muleka gidena. wogaa bagara gidonttako nagaray azakone nu erokoko shin. wogay “amotofa” gonttako amoy azakone tumupe ta erikke. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nagaray qasse wogape kezida azazoy bessida ogen go7ettidi ta gidon dumma dumma iitta amo denithethides. wogay yanappe kasse nagaray hayqithiko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>wogay baynida kase tani paxxa dayisse shin wogay yiini qase nagaray paxxa gidides. ta gidikko hayqadis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>He asi ashana qofetida azazoyka hayqo ekii yidaysa eradis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nagaray woga baggara bettida gaason go7ettidi tana balethidesine azazon wodhides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi wogay ba baggara geeshshikko. azazoyka geesh, xiilone loo7okko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gido attin loo7osu hanidaysi taas hayqos gididee? Mulekka gidena. Gido attin nagaray ba nagaratethan eretana mala loo7o gidida hano bagara ta bolla hayqo ehides. Hesikka nagaray azazo baggara kassepe aathi nagara darisides. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Wogay ayana yo gididaysa nu erosu. Ta qasse nagaras aylle mala bayzetida asikko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tani ta oothizayssa erike. Ta oothana koyzayssa ootha erike shin ta ixxiza miishsh oothays. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ta oothana koyontta miish oothiza gidikko wogay loo7o gididaysa ta marikatays. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa oothizay tana gidontta ta gaathan diza nagaray oothees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tanan hesikka nagarancha gidida ta madhetetha gidon ayko loo7o miishshi baynidayssa ta erays. Loo7o oothanasi taas amotethi dees shin polla ootha erikke. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta oothizay oothana gaada koyza loo7o ootho giden. Gido attin ta oothana koyontta iitta ootho oothays. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tani oothanas koyonttayssa oothiza gidiko hessa oothizay tana gidontta ta gidon diza nagarakko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi haysi wogay oothon dizaysi taas gellides. Hessikka tani loo7o oothana koyaysishin tani iitta oothays. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Tani ta gaathara Xoossa wogan ufa7istays. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido attin ta asatetha gidon oothiza nagara wogay tana qachi oykidi ta qofa wogara oletiza hara wogay ta asatetha gidon oothishin beyays. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ta aymala laafa asee! Hayssa hayqosi imettida asatethafe tana ashanay oonee? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu Goda Yesus Kiristoosa baggara galatay Xoossas gido.</para>
  <para style="p">Histinkko tani ta baggara ta qofan Xoossa wogasi aylle gidashe tani Ta medhetetha wogan nagara wogas aylleko.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Asi xiillo ayanan deyees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Yesus Kiristoosa ammanizayta bolla piriday deena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gaasoykka deyo ayana wogay Yesus Kiristoosa baggara nagarape istta geeshida gishikko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nagarancha ashoppe dendidayssan wogay polanaas danida7ontaysa Xoossi ba naaza nagarancha asa lemusson nagaras yarishistana mala yedidi pollides. Hsitidi nagara iza ashon piridides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessikka nuni ashon gidontta ayanan simeretiza nupe wogay koyza xiillotetha pollanaskko. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Asho shene mala daana koyza asata wozinay ashoy koyza mishan shemipees. Ayana shene mala dizayti qasse ba wizinaa, ayanay koyza miishsh bolla wothetes. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ashos xalala qofay hayqo gidishin ayana yoosi qofay gidiko deyone sarotethikko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nagaras haretiza wozinay Xoossara ooshshakko. Gaasoykka izi Xoossa wogasi haretennane haristanas danida7ena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asho shene mala diza asatikka Xoossu ufaysanasi danida7etena. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte qasse Xoossa ayanay intenan diza gidiko ashon gidontta ayanan deista. Kiristoosa ayanay iza bolla deennadey he uray Kiristoosas gidena. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kiristoosay inte gidon dikko qasse inte asatethay naagara geedon hayqethi gidikokka inte ayanay qase xiillotetha gaason deyon dees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesusa hayqope dinthida iza ayanay inte bolla diza gidiko Kiristoosa hayqope denthidaysa inte gidon diza iza ayanay hayqanas diza inte asatethas deyo immana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ta ishato! hesikka wolliqara hanana shin nu asho shene mala daanas ashosi gidokko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Asho shene mala deyzayssa gidiko inte hayqanane asho ootho iittaza inte ayanan wodhi gidiko inte deyon daana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossa ayanan kallizadenti heytantti istti Xoossa naytakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Inte ekida ayanay zaaridi intena ayletethan hariiza ayana gidontta “nu Aawa abbo” gi xeygisiza naatetha ayana ekidista. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuni Xoossa nayta gididaysa he ayanay ba baggara nu ayanara issife nuusu marikatees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nuni iza nayti gidikko nu iza latizaytako. Nu iza bonchoza latizayta gidana mala adafeka izara iza metoza gishetezayta gidikko nu Xoossu latizadeko; Kirisitossara issife latizayitakko.</para>
  <para style="s">Buro yaana boncho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ha7i nu ekiza waayey buro nuusu sinithan giigi uttida bonchozara gathi xellishin aykokka gidena gays. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Medhetethay wurikka Xoossa nayti qonccanaysa lamotethan naagon dees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Medhetethi wurikka mela hada gidana mala piridettides. Hesikka ba doron gidontta sinithafes haristana mala izi ba shene mala harisida gishaskko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hesikka medhetethi wurikka dhayssa aylletethafe wozitidi Xoossa naytasi gidida gede bonichitida shene mala dizaso gakanaskko. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ha7i gakanas medhetethi wurikka mixxa mala waayen shenotishe dizaysa nu erosu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iza xalala gidontta koyro ayana ayfe demmida nunikka nu asatethay attana nu iza na gidanaysaka lamotishene wozinara mixxatishe dosu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hayssa ha ufaysan xalala attidosu. Ufaysi qasse ayfen betiza miishsh gidiko burope naagiza miishsh gidena; Ha7i ba ayfen beyza miishshi buropes nagiizadey oonee? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Gido attin nuni buro nu ayfen beyontta miish ufaysan naagiza gidikko salistay baynida naagosu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hesathokka qasse nu daburishin ayanay nuna maades. Wossa nu wositi wossanakone nu erontta gishshi ayanay nuni qaalan qonccisanas danida7etontta qaalara nusu wosses. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nu wozina paacci eriza ayanay izi ayana qofa eres. Gaasoykka ayanay Xoossa shene mala ammaniza asasi nuusu wosses. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Xoossi bena dosizaytasine iza shene mala xeeygetidaytasi wurisos oothiza miishshi wursikka lo7os oothizaysa nu erosu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Xoossi kasseepe ba erizazayta istti iza naaza milatana mala kasseka doori wothides. hesikka daro ba ishata gidofe izi bayra gidanasa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kasse koyrope ba dooridayta istta xeeygides. Qassekka xeygidata xiilisides. Be xiilisidaytaka bonchides.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Histinni hessa nu ay ginoo? Xoossi nunara gidikko nunara eqistana danida7izay oonee? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Be yellos michetontta nu gishshi oothi immiday izako. Hesitin wuriso miishsh nuusu izara kiyatetha aazas immenee? <verse number="33" style="v"/>Xoossi dooridayta motiza oonee? Xillisizay Xoossa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hisittini piridizay oonee? Hayqidi hayqope denididi Xoossa oshachan uttida Yesus Kiristoosay nu gishshi ganates. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nuna Kiristoosa siqope shakanay oonee? Metoye, waaye, woykko godetethee, woykko gafa, woykko kallotethee woykko qopontta gakiiza metoyee, mashaa? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hesikka kasse “Ne gishshi nu shuketiza dorisa mala qoodettidosu. gallasi kumethi ne gish nuni hayqora baxistana” geeteti xaafetidayssa malako? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nuna aazika shakena. Haysa wurison nuna siqidaysan xoonizaytapekka nu aadhosu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi hayqo gidin deyo gidin kiitanchata gidin woykko ha7i diza miishsh gidin buro yaana miishsha gidin woykko ay wolliqama gidin <verse number="39" style="v"/>Dhoqqa gidin woykko ziqa gidin woykko ay medheteth gidin Goda Yesus Kiristoosa baggara nuusi diza Xoossa siqope nuna shaakana danda7iza miishshi bayndayssa ta shaaka eradis.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossa dooro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta Yesusa sunthan tumu gays; woridotikke; ta wozinaykka xiillo ayana baggara taas marikatees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Taas wozinape kiichontta iitta qofay michay ta wozinan dees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ta baggara asa gishshi ta qanigetidane Kiristoosape shakistada wora wodhidako dosays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Isttikka Isiraa7eele naytako. Istti Xoossa na gidana mala Xoossa bonchoyne caaqo qaalay ne wogayne Xoossa keeththa woga ufaysi isttasi imetides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kase Aawatikka istta bagga Kiristoosa asho baggara istta zeretha zariken qoodetes. Izikka wurisofe bolla gidida medhinas galatetida Xoossa; amin7i. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Gido attin hessa guussi Xoossa qaalay attides guussu gidena. Isiraa7eelepe yelettiday wuri Isiraa7eele gidenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Abiramepe yelettidayti izape yelletida gishshi wurikka iza yellista gidetena shin “Ne zerethi Yisaqa bagara xeygistana” geetetida mala hanides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa guussikka Xoossa na geetetidayti istti ashon yellidayta gidetena shin Abirame nayta geetettizayti burope yellistanaytakko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Yiza Layth hani wode ta ha simmana; Sarayka nees attuma na yellana” geetetidi izas ufaysa qaalay imettides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa xalalaka gidena. Iribiqa nayti issade nakko. Izikka nu Aawa Yisaqakko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Meniteti yelletidi buro iitta woykko kiya oothontta dishin Xoossa qofay miinana mala <verse number="12" style="v"/>Oothon gidontta xeeygidayssafe gidida gishshi “Bayray kaallozas haaristana” geetetidi Iribiqas yootides. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessikka “Ta Yaqobe dosadis; Eessa ixxadis” geeteti kasse xaafetida mala hanides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Histin nu ha7i ay ginoo? Xoossi besontta ogera maadi erizee? Muleka maadi erena. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Xooss Muses “Ta marana koydade marana; Ta Michistana koyza urasikka michistana” gees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gish hesikka assi koyda mala gidontta woykko asa daburan gidontta Xoossa maarida mala hanees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Geesha maxaafey Farone “Ta woliqay ne bolla bistana malane ta sunthi biitta wurisoson yootistana mala ta nena hayssasi denithadis” gees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa gish Xooss marana koyzade maares. Iza wozina muumisana koyzade wozana muumises. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Intefe isadey “Histin hanoy heyssa mala gidiko nuna hano gakanasi aazas waayisizee? Gaasoykka iza shene digana danida7izay oonee?” gaada oychchontta agaka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin Xoossas mallithe zaara immizay ne oonee? “Oothetida miishshi, zaaridi oothidayssa ne tana aazas hayssatho oothadii?” gi erizee? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Uriqqa medhizadey he uriqafe bagga bonichos bagga qasse coo hiriyso oothosi medhanas iza shene gidenee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Xoossikka ba hanqqo besanasine ba wolliqa erisanasi koydi iza hanqqo qoniccisizayta dhayanasi giigetidayta dhayssontta agagikkochii! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Koyro bonichos gigisida iza marotetha besizaytas iza bonicho duretethay eretana mala izi oothanaskko. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Xeygidadey Ayhudata baggafe xalala gidontta hanko dereza baggafe gidida nunakka ashontta xeygides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hose7e maxaafan</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ta dere gidontayta tani ta dereta”</para>
  <para style="q1">ga xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q1">“dosetonttayta iistta ta dosetidayta” gada xeygana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qasseka</para>
  <para style="q1">“Inte ta dere dekista geeteti yootteidason henka &lt;Isiti deyo Xoossa nayta&gt; geteti xeygistana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Isayasaykka Isra7eele nayta gish hizigi yootides “Isra7eele nayta qoday abba acce mala darikokka guuthati xalala attana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Goday ba pirida biitta bolla elle piridana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessikka kase Isiyasay “Woga Goday nusu zerethi ashonitako nu sodoma katama malane gamira katama mala nukka dhayanashin” geetetidi kasse Isayasa dunani yootidaysa mala hanides.</para>
  <para style="s">Isiraa7eele nayatane mishshiracho qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Histin nu ay giinoo? Amanon bettida xiilloteth demanas hanko dere asay daburontta demides. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Gido attin xiillotetha wogaa kaalliza Isiraa7eele nayti demibeytena. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessi aazas hessaththo hanidee? Istti ammanon gidonta oothon demana kallida gishshikko. Isttikka dhuphe shuchan dhuphetida. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessikka “Hekko asa dhuphiza shuchu</para>
  <para style="q1">Istta kunidisiza zala xiyone bolla ta wothana,</para>
  <para style="q1">Iazn ammanizadey yelletena”</para>
  <para style="q1">geetetidi kasse geeshsha maxaafan xaafetidayssa mala hanides.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato Isra7eele nayta gishshi ta amaone ta Xoossu wossizay istti dhayonta attanaskko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Istti Xoossa yoosi michetizayta gididaysa ta istta gishshi marikatana danida7ays; Istta michetethi gidiiko eratethan gidena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xooss asi xiillisiza oge erontta aggidi ba xiillotethas oge kaallida attin Xoossa xiillotetha oge kaallibeyttena. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Amaniza asa wursi xillisanas Kiristoosay woga wuris polides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Musey Woga baggara bettiza xiilotetha gish erisishe “Hayta wogata polli oothizadey ha wogatan daana” gizayssakko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ammanon bettiza xillotethi qase hiziges “Ne wozinara pud sallo oonee baanayii? gopa” hesstho gussi Kiristoosa sallope duge ha wothana gussukko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Woykko &lt;Duge cimman oonee wodhanayii? goppa” hesikka Kiristoosa hayqope buro denithana guussukko. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attin qaalay ay gize “Qaalay ne achan dees; ne dunanine ne wozinan dees. Nuni ammano gishshi sabakiiza qaalay hayssakko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neni ne dunara “Yesusay Goda” gaada marikatiko Xoossi iza hayqope denithidayssa ne wozinan ne ammanikko attana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neni xiillanay wozinan ammanikoko shin ne atanay ne dunara marikatikoko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Geesha maxaafay giza mala “Izan ammanizay wurikka yellatena.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ayhudata gidonine hiniko dere asa gidon dumatethi dena. Issi Goday wurisosikka Godakko. Iza wossizayta gujj anjes. <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Goda sunithu xeygizayti wurikka atana” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafetides. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Histin iza ammanonttayti iza wozigi xeyganee? Qasse iza gishshi siyontta dishe wossiti ammananee? Sabakey baynida dishin wossiti siyanee? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kitetonita wositi sabakanideto? Hesikka “mishiracho qaala ekkii yizayta yuus ay mala loo7o” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafetida mala hanides. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Gido attin siydayti wurikka Mishiracho qaala ekibeyttena; Isayasay “Godo nu yootidaysa ooni ammanidee?” gida mala hanides. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi ammanoy bettizay yootiza qaala siyethankko. yootetiza qaalaykka Kiristoosa gishshi yootiza qaalapekko. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gido attin asay siybeyneshaa? aada ta oychays; tumape asay siydes; Geesha maxaafan xaafettida mala “Ista qaalay biitta wurisonine alame gaxxa gakanasi siyetides.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta qasseka oychays; Isra7eele nayti qaalaa eribeyteneshaa? Koyiro Musey isttas “Ta dere gidonttaytan ta istta mindasana; yuushi qopontta deretan ta istta yilochana” gides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Isayasaykka xalatethan “Tana koyonttaytas ta bettadis; tana oychonttaytas tana qonicisadis” gides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Isiraa7eele gishshi qase “Taas azazetontta derekone taas eeno gontta dereko kumetha gallas ta kushe miccadis” gees.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Isiraa7eele asape attidayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Histin Xoossi dereta yegi agidee? Gaada ta oychays; Muleka agibeyna; takka ta baggara Biniyame zarike, Abirame zereth gidida Isiraa7eele asakko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Xoossi koyrope ba erida dereza yegibeyna. Elasay Isiraa7eele nayta bolla motoy Xoossakko wozigi shishshidakone geesha maxaafay iza gishshi ay gizakone inte eriketii? <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Godo! istti ne nabeta wodhida. nees yarishizasoka lallida. Qasse tani tarka atadis. Tanaka wodhana geetes. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Xoossi isttas hizgi zaarides “Ba7alle geeteiza Eeqas goynonttayta laapun shihi asi taas ashshadis.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa malaka ha7i ha wodezanika Xoossa kiyatethan Isiraa7eele asape dooreti attida guuthati deetes. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Histtin hessi Xoossa kiyatethan gidiko asa oothon gidena. Asa oothon gididaakko Xoossa kiyateth, kiyateh gidena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Histin ay gaanee? Isiraa7eele nayti loo7ethi koydayssa demmibeyttena. Xoossan dooretidayti gidiko demmida. Haniko attidayta wozinay muumides. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kase “Istta ayfey xeelontta mala, istta hayitheyka siyontta mala Xoossi hanno ha gallasiyo gakanaas isttas doccisiza ayana immides” geeteti geesha maxaafan xaafetida malakko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Dawiteykka</para>
  <para style="q1">“Istta maaday istta oykiza narixa gido; Istta dhuphizazine qixate gido.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Istta ayfey xeellofo goozzeto;</para>
  <para style="q1">Istta zokkoy medhinas kuuno” gides.</para>
  <para style="s">Isiraa7eele dere asi gidontta dere asatikka attana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aner qasse ta zaara oychays, Isiraa7eele asay nam77antho kunddethafe dendanee? dendana. harappeka Isiraa7eele nayta qanatisana gishshi istta mooro gaason atotethi hankko deretas gakkides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gido attin qasse istta hanko dere asas anjjo gidides. Istta kunidethika qasse hanko deretas anjjo gidiko istti simmi attidakko ay mala gita anjjo gidandeeshin! <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hankko Dere asazo, ta intes yootays, ta hanko dere asas kiittetidade gidida gishshi ta oothoza ta minnada polana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessikka ta bagga asati minidatana mala denithethada isttafe guutha asata ashshanaas ufaysan oothays. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Xoossi istta aggida hanko dere asay Xoossara giigikko Xoossi Isiraa7eele nayta zaaridi ekkiza wode intes aazi hanazi milattizee? Hessa guusi “hayqqope dendides” guusa malakko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Koyro bukasoy loo7o gidikko hanko izappe oothetizaas wurikka loo7okko. Hessaththoka issi miththa xaphphoy loo7o gidikko hanmkko iza bolla diza hanigetikka loo7o gideetes. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Keththa dan77on diza miththa hangista malati inte meqqi wodhdhin hankko woran diza miththata milatiza hankko dere asati inte olla gididi inte haaronne inte anjjo shaaki ekkizadentta gidikko; <verse number="18" style="v"/>Heyta he meqqi wodhdhida hangista bolla othoretofa. inte istta bolla otoretiko qasse hanno wozinan wothite. He miththaa tookiday nena gidaka. miththay nena tookides attin. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Histinko “He hanigeti meqqi wodhdhiday nuni istta olla gelana malakko” gontta agekista. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tumu gidista shin istti meqiday ammano paceppe denididayssankko. Inteka ammanon eqidista. Babbite attin otoretofite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossi koyrope diza hanigistas michetonttade gidiko inteskka michetena. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Xoossa kiyatethine iza menxxe iittatetha ane xeella. Iza menxxe iittethay kunididayta bollakko. Iza kiyatethay qasse inte iza qadhetetha garisan diza wode gakanaas xalalakko. Hessi baynida aggiko intekka qanixistana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Istti ammanontta minni eqidasope simmiko kase beso simmi gelana. Xoossika istta zarisi gelithana danida7ees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Inte bazo miththafe qanixettida kase inte medhetethafe gidontta loo7o miththan inte gelana danida7iko koyrope ba medhetetha hanigista gididayti heyti kase iza bolla diza miththan simmi geloy isttas waani hanenee?</para>
  <para style="s">Isiraa7eele asay wurikka attana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ta ishato, inte ciincca asi gididayssa intes milatontta mala hayssa gido xuura yooza inte erontta attana mala ta koyke. Hesikka hiniko dere asape xeygetidayti wuri ammanana gakanaas Isiraa7eele nayta wozinay muumides. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi Isiraa7eele nayti wurikka attana. “Ashshizadey Xiyonepe yaana; Yaqobepeka iittateth digana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tni istta nagara wursa dhayssidape guye ta isttara caaqon geliza qaalay hessako. geetetidi kase geesha maxaafan xaafettida mala handes. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Intes hanko deretas Mishiracho qaalay gakana mala Isiraa7eele nayti Xoossan ixettida asi gidida. Gidikokka kase dooro mala gidiko ba Aawata baggara istti dosettidaytakko. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Xoossi dooridappene ba kiyateth immmidape guye ba oothida miishan simmidi handattena. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Inteka kase azazetonttaytako. Istti azazetontta ixxin ha7i intena maaridayssatho <verse number="31" style="v"/>Xoossi Intena maarida geedon isttika maaristana mala ha7i azazetonttayta gidida. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xoossi wursika maaranas asi wuriska azazetontta mala goridides.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoosse sabbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Xoossa cinccatethine iza erateth ay mala ciimma! Iza priday ay malakone paacetena. Izi adhida geedoyka eretena. <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Goda wozina eriday oonee? Izas zore immiday oonee?” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Xoossi zaari immana mala izas tal77e immiday oonee? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wurikka izape, izain, izasko. Izas bonichoy medhinape medhinas gido. Amini7i.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossas bessiza Deyo yarsho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hesa gishshi ta ishato inte asatetha geeshine Xoossu ufaysiza paxa yarsho oothidi inte shiishshana mala ta intena Xoossa qadhetan woossays. Hesikka wozinamma asa mala inte Xoossas oothiza oothokko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Loo7o ufaysizazine kumeth gididazi Xoossa sheney azakone inte paaci erana mala inte qofan oraxidi lamettite attin hayssa alame asa milatopite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Intes Xoossi immida ammano mala interika intena paaci xeellite attin ha7i dizaysafe bolara intena dhoqisi xeellontta mala tani taas imettida Xoossa kiyatethan intena issa issa zorays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nupe issi issi uras issi asatetha bolla daro biliteti diza mala heytikka he biliteti issi mala ootho oothonttaysatho <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessaththoka nuni darota gidi uttidi Kiristoosan issi ashoko. Nuni issay issas ashokko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nuusi immetida imota mala dumma dumma imotethi dees. Isades burope hananazi yooto gidiko izades immetida ammano mala yooto. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Oothi maadizadey oothi maado. Tamarisizadeyka tamariso. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Zorizade gidiko zoro. Baynidaytas immizadey gujji immo. Aysizadey minni aysso. maarizadeyka ufaysan maaro.</para>
  <para style="s">Siiqo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Inte siqotethi qoodhepe qomo gidopo. Iitta gididayssa wursikka ixxite. Loo7o gididayssara issife oykettite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Inte inte garisan issay issara ishata mala loo7ethi siqetite. Issay issa beppe aathi bonichizayta gidite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Godas oothana ayanan xugetizayta gidite attin hessa he minotethafe guye gooppite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ufayssan ufa7etizayta gidite; meto danida7ite; woossan minnite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ammanishe waayetizaytas intes dizayssafe shaaki immite. Imath mokite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Intena qanigizayta anjjite attin qanigofite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ufa7etizaytara ufa7etite; muzotizaytara muzotite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte inte garisan dosetethan diite. Maniqotara isopetethan daanas koyte attin otoropitene ceeqetopite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Oonasikka iitta gishshi iitta zaaropite. Asi wuriso achan loo7o miishshi oothanas minnite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Intes danida7etiko inte inte baggara asi wurisora saron diite. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta siiqoto, inte halo Xoossi kesso attin interika halo kesopite “Halo kesanay tanakko” gees Goday geeteti geeshsha maxaafan xaafetides. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Halo kessanape “Neni ne morikey gafiko muza; izi saamotiko usha; ne hessaththo oothiko tama boniqo iza bolla korasa” geetetidi geeshsha maxaafan xaafetides. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iitta loo7o oothon xoono attin iittan xonettofa.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ayzaytas azazeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ay asikka bena aysiza daanatas haaristana bessis. Xoossafe imetontta dishin daanatethi deena. Ha7i diza daanati Xoossafe daanatidaytakko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi daana bolla makali7idey Xoossa woga bolla makali7ees. He makali7izaytika ba bolla pirida eheetes. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Dere aysizati iitta oothizayta babiseetes attin loo7o oothizayta babisetena. Ne dere aysizades babbontta agana koyazii? Histinko loo7o ootha; izikka nena galatana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Izi nees loo7o oothanas Xoossa oothanichako. Gido attin ne iitta oothida gidiko izas babba. Gaasoyka izi masha coo mela gixxiibeyna; Izi iitta oothizade qaxayanas Xoossa oothanichako. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi iza qixxetes babo xalala gidontta ne qofapankka daanatizades azazistanas besses. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inte giira immizay hessaskko. Aysizayti hessa he oothoza bolla Xoossi istta wothides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Isttafe issas issas bessizayssa immite. Giira immana besizaytas giira immite; qaraxa qanxxanaas bessizaytas qaraxa qanxxite; Babanas bessizaytas babbite; bonichanas bessizata bonichite.</para>
  <para style="s">Wodey matida gish inte garisan siiqetite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte garisan issay issara siiqetethafe attin oona bollaka accoy doopo. Ase siiqiza uray izi wogaa pollides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Laymatopa”, “Wodhopa”, “amotofa” gizaytane hara azazoti diikokka “Asi wursaka ne mala siiqa” giza hanno issi wogayn wurikka kuyettides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>siiqoy asa bolla iitta oothena; Hessa gishshi siiqoy woga wurisos kuusha. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hayssa wodaa cadi xeellidi hessa oothite. Ha7i hana inte dhisikofe denidiza wodeko. Nu kase ammanosope haa simmin ha7i nuus attiza wodey matides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qamay aadhin wonttana gees. Hessa gishshi ane nu dhuma ootho wora yeggidi poo7o olla miishshe mayosu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Gallasara hamutiza mala ane wogara hamutosu. magulithanine matho gidon; laymma amonine laymman gidopo; qanatetethanine palaman gidopo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa aggidi Yesus Kiristoosa mayte. Asho amo polanaas qopofite.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Asa bolla piridofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inte garisan ammanon buro minnonttade shiishi ekkite attin iza qofa bolla piridofite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Issi issi asi bettidayssa wursi maanas ammanoy dees. Qase ammanon minonta uray akakilate xalala mees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bettidayssa wursi mizadey wursi monttade kadhopa. Monitadey qasse mizade bolla piridofo. Xoossi wursaka ekides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Haniko oothizade bolla piridizadey ne oonee? Izadey kunidiko woykko eqikoka iza Godas. Goday iza esanas danidaeza gishshi izi eqandes. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Issadey gallasatape issi gallas hara gallasafe aathidi bessi dumma gallasi gi qopees. Hara uray qasse gallasati wurikka issi gina gi qopees. Issi issi uray ootho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Issi gallas hara galasafe dummasi qopizadey izi hessa oothizay Goda bonchos gidiko mizadeyka Goda bonchos giidi meesi. Miidi Xoossu galates. Monttadeykka Goda bonchos giidi muusu aggesine Xoossas galata immees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nupe oonikka bessi dizadeyne beppe bessi hayqizadey deena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu diikoka Godas dosi. Hayqikoka Godas hanqosu. Hessa gishshi diikoka woykko hayqiko nu Godaskko. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa gishshi hayqidaytasine paxxa dizatas Goda gidanasi Kirisitoosay hayqidi Hayqoppe paxxi denidides. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Histin ne aazas ne isha bolla piridazii? Aazasi ne isha leqazii? Nu wurikka Xoossa pirida womibara sinith shiqos doosu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ta paxxa days. Gulibatey wurikka taasi gulibatana. Inxarisi wuri Xoossas marikatana” geeteti kase geesha maxaafan xaafetides. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hesa gishshi nuni issi issi uray Xoossas Xoossa sinthi shiiqidi nu ootho gishshi izas zaaro immana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gish nuni nu garisan isay isa bolla piridanape ane naagetos. Hesa aggidi nu ishas dhuphe gidizayssa woykko iza oykiza narxxa wothontta mala ane nu naagetos. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tani Goda Yessusan amanida miza kaththan tunay baynidaysa eradis. Gido attin isadey isi miish tuna gi qopiko he mishay izadesi tunako. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neni ne isha miza kaththa geedon dhuphe gidiko siiqoni simeristabeyka. Kirisitoosay iza gish haniqida ne isha ne miza kaththa gaason wodhopa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Inte loo7o giidi popiza mishi iitta getistana mala oothofite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossa kawotethi xiilo ayanani bettida xilloteth sarotethine ufaysafe attin Muusa yoone usha yoo gidena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Haysatho Krisitosas oothizadey Xoossu ufaysesinne asa achanika galatetes. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gish sarotethi betiza ogene nuni nu garisani loo7onas besiza oge ane koyosu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nuni Miza kaththa gish giidi Xoossa ootho ane laaloko. kathi wurikka geeshkko. Gido attiin hara urasi dhuphe gidiza kaath muusi qass balla oothoko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ne ishasi dhuphe gidizazi gidiko ashoka manapene woyne ush uyanape woykko ay mishika ne oothontta aggiko lo7oko. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gish haytantta milatiza mishatasi neesi diza ammanoy ne gidonine Xoossa gidon deyo. Haysi likeko giidi ammanon ekida mishan berika ba bolla piridonttadey izadey anijjetidadeko. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido attin wozinara sidhishe miiko izi ammanon moontta gish iza bolla piridetides. Ammanoni oothonttazi wurikka nagara.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuni amanoni minidayti hanko amanoni minotayi meto tokanasi besisi attiin nu Xoossa ufaetizayta gidanaso nusu besena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nuni wurikka nu lageista gusasine ista ufaysizazi othanasi beses. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kirisitossa bena ufaysiza oothonita “Isiti nena cayda caashay ta bolla gakiides” geteti kase xafetidaysi hanides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neni gesha maxapistape demiza danida7ane minotethi nusi dana mala korope xafetidaysi wurikka nu izpe nuusi timirite demanamala xafetides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Minotethine danida7a immiza Xoossi inte Yessus Kirisitosa kallishin intesi inte gidon ayana isipetetha iimo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hesika inte isi wozinane isi dona gididi nu Goda Yessus Krisitossa Godan ayana bonichanasa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gish Xoosu galatanasi inte Kiristossa ekidamala isi isaka ekite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kasse awatas imetida ufaysa qaala polanaso Xoossa tumatetha gish gidi Krisitossa Ayhudatasi othizade gididaysa ta intesi yotanas. <verse number="9" style="v"/>hessathoka dere asati iza marotetha gish Xoossu galatanamala geteti kasse xafetida mala “Hesa gish ta nena dere gidoni galatana ne sunithaka ta yessana.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qasse “Haniko dere asato inteka iza deretara ufa7etite” ges <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nam7nithoka Zaniko derey inte wurikka Goda galatite derey wuri iza sabiite” ges. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hesatho Isiayasan “Be dere asa bolla kawotiza iseyo nay yana. Yana Derey iza ufaysani nagana” ges. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inite izan amaniza gish ufaysa Xoossi intesi ufaysine sarotethi kunitho. Hesikka xiillo ayana woliqa ufaysany intesi wogape adhi gukanasa. Haniko deretas othanicha gidida Phawulossa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte loo7ethan kumidayta erateth wurisoni kumidaytane harata zorinas eray dizayta gididaysa ta adafe shaka eradis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta Xoossafe ekida imotetha gina qaseka intena qofisanasi isi isi yota bolla xalatethan intesi xafadis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossa wonigilan qasetetha oothoy hanko deretasi Yessusi Krisitossa oothanicha gidanasa. Hesikka hiniko derey xillo ayanan Xoossasi dumatidi Xoossi ekiza yarsho gidanasa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hesa gish tani Xoossas oothiza gish Yessusa Krisitossan ceeqetays. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta yotidaysanine ta oothidaysani hanko dere asay Xoossi azaistana mala Kirisitosa azazistana mala Kirisitossay tana gididi oothidazape attin hara hasa7ana xalike. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hesikka haniday xillo ayana woliqani malatata bera hanides. Hesa malanika Yerusalame iliwaqore yehsi gakanasi ta Kirisitossa wonigila polla sabaladisi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hara uray kasse oothidasoni ta gelonitamala gada kasse Krisitossa sunitha xeygeti eronitason wonigila sabakanaysi tasi ommo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Harapeka “Iza gish istasi yotitonitati iza beyana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hesa gidoni ta intiko bonitamala daro wode digistadis. Oerome beyanasi Phawulossa gegetethi <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hi7 qasi tasi hani oothoy baynida gish daro laythape ha sinini intena beyanasi ta daro lamotaadis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Haysa ta qofa tani isidhaniya biiza polanasi qopaysi. Hara adhashe intena beyanasine intenara gutha wode gami7ada lamota othadamala inte tana ta banasa madanamala ufaysi othoyso. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Isi qasse hani diza amanizayta athi madana hai Yerusalame baysa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Gasoykka Maqidoniyayne akayay Yerusalameni diza maiqota madana denidida. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Adaka ista madanasi dosida adafe” Isita ocoraa detes. Haniko dere asay Ayhudata ayana anijjo gishetidayta gidida gish biitafe dumida anjo Ayhuda asara gishatasi ista bolla accoy des. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hesa ghsi ta oothoza wursida hayssa isti ekanakone eridape guye isidhiniya bana ta hera adhashe initena beyana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta ha inteka bashe intesi Kirisitossa anijo kunitha eka banaysa ta erays. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta ishato tani Xoossa wosan baxetizamala inteka tanara baaxistanamala diza ta oothoykka hani amanizayta achan ekistanamala tasi wosite. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nuni Yhudan diza manonita asa kushepe nu atanamalane Yerusalame diza ta oothoyka heni amanizayta achan ekistanamalatas wosite. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hesikka Xoossa shenemala he inteko ta ufaysara banamalane intenara isipe oraxanasa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Saroteha Goday intenara wurisotara gido amn7i.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kinkira7ose woossa keeththan oothiza ammanetida michchiyo pebeno intes hadara gays. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ammaniza asas bessiza mokko inte izo Goda sunththan mikki ekkana malane iza intefe koyza ay mishshanka inte izo maaddana mala ta intena qofisays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kase tanara Goda Yesus kiristoosas issife oothida Pirisiqilasine Aqilas ta saroka gathite. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Istti ta gishshi hayqqana gakanas bena aathi immida tana xalala gidontta hanko deretape ammandaytape istta galatetes. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Istta keeththan diza ammaniza asaka saro giite. Isiyape koyro kiristoosa n ammanida ta siiqoza Ephenexose saro giite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Intes daro daaburidaro maaramo saro giite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tnara issife qachchetida Anddiraqoonene Yuliyane saro giite. Heytanti hawarista garisan lo7o sunththara dizaytane kiristoosa taape kase ammanidaytako. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tani Goda baggara daro siiqiza Philyaxone saro giite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kiristoosa ootho tanara issife oothiza Irobanene ta siiqiza Senxxkeka saro giite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kiristoosan iza ammanoy paacetidi galatetida Aphilises ta saroka gathite. Arisxabalo so asasikka ta sarota gathite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta dabbo Herodiyona saro giite. Godan diza Niriqqaso so asa saro giite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Godan gididi minotethan oothiza macashata Tirifimonone Xirofimono saro giite. Godas oothon daro daaburidaaris tani izo siiqiza Xarsidis ta saroka gathite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Godan doorettida Rufonoosone taas Aayo gididaris iza Aayeys ta saroka yootite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asqqerinene Afilesonpha, Herimene, Phaxirobane, Herimanene isttara diza ishata wurisotas ta saroka gathite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Filegones, Yuliyas, Neriyasone iza micheyis hessathoka Alixones isttara diza ammanizaytaskka ta saroka gathite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Issay issa yeer yeer ekkidi sarothetite. Kiristoosan ammaniza woossa keeththa asay wurikka intena saro gees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta ishato asa garisan shaaketeth medhizaytape inte tamarida timirtta ekkontta ixxon intes dhuphe gidiza asatape inte naagetite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Heytantta mala asati Yesus kiristoosas oothizayta gidontta ba qanththa kaththa gishshi oothizaytakko. Shugo qaalara haasa7anine wozina kiya asata balethetes. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Inte mishshiracho qaalas azazetizayta gididayssa asi wuri siyides. Hessika tana daro ufayssides. Gidikkoka inte lo7o hanos cinccata qasse iitta oothos eeyata gidana mala ta koyays. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sarotetha Goday xala7e eeson inte too garisa aathi dinccerethana. Goda Yesus kiristoosa kiyatethi intenara gido. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tanara issife oothiza Xintoosay qasseka ta dabbo Luqiyesay, Iyaasoneyne Susiphixirosay intena saro saro geetes. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hayssa kiitaa xaafiday tani Xerixiyosay intena Goda sunththan saro gays. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tanine hayssan diza kumetha woossa keeththa asa mokki ekkiza Gayiyosayka intena saro gees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Goda Yesus kiristoosa kiyateth intenara wurisotara gido. Amin7i. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tani yootiza michchiracho qaalay Yesus kiristoosa gishshi yootetiza kiitayne beni wodepe dommidi qotan gam7idi ha7i qasse qonccida tuma xuura baggara izi intena ammanon essanaas danda7es. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse hayssi tumay qonccides. Medhina Xoossa azazon wurikka ammanidi azazistana mala nabeta maxaafa baggara dereti wurikka iza erana mala handes. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Izi xalala era gidida Godas Yesus kiristoosa baggara medhina bonchoy izas gido. Amin7i.</para>
</usx>
